OL,3,GNEWSAThe Voice singer Ciiara Nyx says
OL,4,Amusic helped her navigate her trans
OL,5,Aidentity
OL,6,
OL,7,FA singer who won over all four coaches
OL,8,Fon The Voice UK has said music helped
OL,9,Fher make sense of the "complex"
OL,10,Ffeelings she experienced growing up as
OL,11,Fa transgender woman.
OL,13,FCiiara Baker, 21, who performs as
OL,14,FCiiara Nyx, earned a coveted four-chair
OL,15,Fturn during the ITV talent show's blind
OL,16,Fauditions after performing Glory Box by
OL,17,FPortishead.
OL,19,FSpeaking to the BBC, she said
OL,20,Fsongwriting had become an important
OL,21,Foutlet after she came out as trans at
OL,22,Fthe age of 15.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
